<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AMIC GIVES TERMS OF RIGHTS OFFER.</title>
<headline>AMIC GIVES TERMS OF RIGHTS OFFER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Industrial Corp (AMIC) gave the terms of its 1.2 billion rand rights offer announced on September 20.</p>
<p>A statement said it would offer 8,196,340 new ordinary share of one rand each at a subscription price of 145 rand per share, on the basis of 12 new ordinary shares for every 100 shares held in AMIC at the close of busines on October 4.</p>
<p>It said a further statement giving salient dates of the rights offer would be issued on October 2.</p>
<p>- Johannesburg newsroom +2711 482-1003</p>
</text>
